===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|vitriol}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|vitriolum||sulphuric acid}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|vitrum||glass}}.

===Pronunciation===
